# TensorRT engines are machine-specific: a plan is tied to the GPU architecture,
# driver and TensorRT version that built it, so a committed .engine is unusable to
# anyone else (and routinely exceeds GitHub's 100MB file limit). Build locally from
# the .pt -- see docs/setup.md.
*.engine

# Downloaded/exported result archives
*.zip

# Dataset sources for world model and weapon classifier
data
